<footer class="footer">
  <div class="wrapper">

  <div class="column logo">
    <div class="logo-footer"></div>
  </div>

  {{!-- Link columns are injected at runtime by 17-footer.js from the published
        fragment (<uiRootPath>/fragments/footer-links.html), so they can be updated
        by republishing just the assets — no page rebuild. Empty by design: this is
        the minimal static footer (logo + copyright only) when JS is off / the fetch
        fails. display:contents keeps injected columns as direct flex children of
        .wrapper, so the layout is unaffected. --}}
  <div id="footer-links" class="footer-links-slot"></div>

    <div class="column copyright">
    <p>© <span id="footer-copyright-year">{{year}}</span> Neo4j, Inc.
      <a href="https://neo4j.com/terms/">Terms</a> | <a href="https://neo4j.com/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="https://neo4j.com/docs/sitemap_index.xml">Sitemap</a></p>
    {{!-- The trademark list dates fast (products get renamed/added/dropped)
          and was previously baked here, meaning a change needed a full
          docs-ui release plus every docset rebuilding before it reached any
          published page. Fetched + injected at runtime by 17-footer.js from
          the published fragment (<uiRootPath>/fragments/footer-trademarks.html),
          same as the link columns above, so it can be updated by republishing
          just that asset. This baked copy is the fallback for no-JS/fetch
          failure - keep it in sync with the fragment when either changes. --}}
    <div id="footer-trademarks">
    <p>Neo Technology<sup>®</sup>, Neo4j<sup>®</sup>, Cypher<sup>®</sup>, Neo4j Bloom<sup>™</sup>, Neo4j Graph Data Science Library<sup>™</sup>, Neo4j<sup>®</sup> Aura<sup>™</sup>, and
      Neo4j<sup>®</sup> AuraDB<sup>™</sup> are registered trademarks
      of Neo4j, Inc. All other marks are owned by their respective companies.</p>
    </div>
  </div>


</div>
</footer>
